title: '[[id:52296843-a251-46ff-a207-54a952b171ca][Jeff already has a list of the mail he has not touched; what costs him is how much of it is stale, as ''to Jeff'' stood on 2026-11-14]]'
pid: 8bf439b1-07a3-4446-a219-d0b7198a6476
body: |2-
  Reading Top's mail to Jeff as he would. The unread filter exists in
  his fork's subscribee folder; about half of what it lists asks
  nothing of him, and only the sender can remove it. Also two frictions
  met on the way, each with its owner; the four bugs and frictions met
  with them were fixed by 2026-11-15, and are in Git.
